Applied with `git apply doc/wip/r2rewrite-measure-probe.patch`, this adds an
env-gated probe to the plugin's trusted decompile entry: with
`R2REWRITE_MEASURE=1` set, every function canonicalised on the way past prints
one stderr line of counts and microseconds. It is not wired into rendering and
must not be committed to the plugin -- the renderer wiring is step 2e, owned by
the integration branch. It exists so the arena-versus-spelled cast measurement
can be reproduced:

    git apply doc/wip/r2rewrite-measure-probe.patch
    make -C r2plugin RUST_FEATURES=all-archs install
    R2REWRITE_MEASURE=1 tests/corpus/sweep.sh tests/corpus/artifacts/bin/h_x64_O2
    git checkout -- Cargo.lock r2plugin/
